            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An assembly comprising: an anchor baseplate having a top surface and a bottom surface; an elongated post coupled to the anchor baseplate so it depends from the bottom surface, the elongated post externally defining a screw; a blind bore, extending into the elongated post, defining an open top end with the top surface, and being at least partially threaded; and a tool port formed adjacent the open top end and dimensioned to accommodate a tool for rotating.</p>
            </abstract>
